  "visual_differences": {
    "all": "Saturday replaces Thursday in the 10:00 HUD. Clock and wallet type and alignment, HUD edges and the trust bar treatment differ. The coin and trust numbers match the pictured fixtures.",
    "h01_h04_h05_h10": "Live map uses different marker and gate rings, label outlines and slight type and palette differences. It also shows the inherited Make up Dhuhr action. The bottom toolbar and bar widths, button spacing and canal-label coverage differ. h10 places navigation above the quay bar. The h04 carrying line is below the board actions and the h05 line sits inline beside the gate actions.",
    "h02_h03_h06_h08": "Daylight runtime greybox and named capsules at the quay and gate replace the detailed prototype views. World framing and lighting differ. The panels use live font metrics, padding, opacity and button widths. The offer line wraps after Abbas in the runtime.",
    "h07_h09": "The market-lane greybox replaces the detailed storefront backdrop. Panel bounds, letter spacing, typography and button widths differ. The locked speaker, outcome and good/bad labels match."
  },
  "pre_release_scholar_review": "Pending under OA-AIOS-432. DOC-TFG-0320 row 1 covers the underlying Friday timing. Quran 4:58 on rendering trusts and the inherited LOCK 7 application of Quran 62:9 to Friday trade closure have no dedicated checklist row."
